    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868600/extras/aaeea9d867cbf639f72d2b5265581db6.avif?t=1644613450\" /></div><br><br><i><strong>FIGHTING HEART</strong> is a 3D 1v1 fighting game, bringing the speed and precision of classic fighters into the third dimension.</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>LIBERATING MOVEMENT</strong></h2>Move freely in 8 directions. Jump, duck, dash and dodge your way to victory.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>COLORFUL CHARACTERS</strong></h2>Play as larger-than-life fighters, using less than realistic <strong>special moves</strong> and techniques.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CUSTOMIZE YOUR BATTLES</strong></h2><strong>Mutators</strong> let you shake up your gameplay. Add instant kill divekicks, air-dashes, dwarfism, and more.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MASTER CHALLENGING TECHNIQUES</strong></h2>Mechanics such as Evasion Cancel let you spend meter to escape or extend combos with good timing, while 1-frame links and juggling open the door to devastating damage.",
